1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,803
Walking the Camino

2
00:00:00,803 --> 00:00:01,870
from Sarria?

3
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:03,509
These are its 5 stages.

4
00:00:03,509 --> 00:00:04,983
Sarria to Portomarín:

5
00:00:04,983 --> 00:00:06,276
14 miles of villages

6
00:00:06,276 --> 00:00:07,667
and country lanes.

7
00:00:07,667 --> 00:00:09,529
Portomarín to Palas de Rei,

8
00:00:09,529 --> 00:00:10,424
with gentle climbs

9
00:00:10,424 --> 00:00:11,761
and small villages.

10
00:00:11,761 --> 00:00:13,063
Palas de Rei to Arzúa,

11
00:00:13,063 --> 00:00:14,151
the longest.

12
00:00:14,151 --> 00:00:14,755
If you like,

13
00:00:14,755 --> 00:00:15,617
split it with a night

14
00:00:15,617 --> 00:00:16,566
in Melide.

15
00:00:16,566 --> 00:00:17,803
Arzúa to A Rúa,

16
00:00:17,803 --> 00:00:19,324
through woods and hamlets.

17
00:00:19,324 --> 00:00:20,884
And A Rúa to Santiago,

18
00:00:20,884 --> 00:00:21,294
all the way

19
00:00:21,294 --> 00:00:22,480
to the Cathedral.

20
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,685
69 miles and

21
00:00:23,685 --> 00:00:24,946
your Compostela.

22
00:00:24,946 --> 00:00:26,616
Save this for your Camino.
